# settings-scheme-flip (D4, D7): System follows the system while the panel is open. Opened by a
# click on a dark system, Tron Cyan picked by a click and the arrows (down to Midnight Violet and
# back, so the focus line shows on its row in both engines: a click focuses a row without it), the
# pointer resting in the gap; then the system turns light (emulateMedia on the reference and the
# web build, SDL's theme event natively): the page and the panel take Clean Teal at once, the help
# line says light, the list keeps its rows and its new content fades in over 160 ms, and the focus
# moves to the checked theme, Clean Teal's row; then the system turns dark again.
# Positions at 1440 x 900 from the reference's DOM with the panel open (tools/run dom): the gear
# (1363, 28, 40 x 40), the panel (1099, 76, 304 x 256); the Appearance toggle's options 91.33 x 34
# from (1113, 112) (System, Light, Dark: centres 1159, 1251, 1343 at y 129); the theme rows 278 x 36
# from (1112, 211), 36 apart (centres at y 229, 265, 301); the help line (1112, 155, 278 x 18); the
# gap between the two settings y 173 to 189. The panel's opening runs 643 ms, so a shot of it at
# rest waits 700.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode system
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 1383 48
wait 700
click 1251 265
key ArrowDown
key ArrowUp
move 1250 181
wait 16
shot dark
scheme light
frames light every 16 for 176
scheme dark
frames dark-again every 16 for 176
